emperature-influence-on-moral-d/spec.md", "location": "spec.md:FR-001", "text": "Potential conflict: FR-001 mandates ingesting ERA5 temperature data using timestamps, while FR-014 requires rejecting any external source that does not meet the hourly\u2011resolution standard. If the chosen ERA5 dataset fails the hourly\u2011resolution check, FR-014 would forbid ingestion, directly contradicting the mandatory nature of FR-001.", "round": 1}]}